  "fishing_pool": "enchanted-forest",
  "description": "A narrow stone tower with pointed blue roofs stands on a grassy rise above a clear river. Broad steps climb from the lower foreground to its arched door, with a low wooden fence following the edge of the grounds. A blue stream winds behind the tower and drops over several rock shelves on the right. Shrubs, flowers and pale boulders dot the lawns. Beyond the nearby trees, green hills and distant mountains stretch under a bright clouded sky. The staircase and blue roof make the tower easy to recognise from the surrounding forest paths, while the water provides a second clear landmark along its right side.",
